Mood Stabilizers\
Lithium:\
\uc0\u61623  Mechanism: Enhances serotonin and/or GABA functions.\
\uc0\u61623  Therapeutic Range: 0.6-1.2 mEq/L (narrow therapeutic window).\
\uc0\u61623  Contraindications: Avoid diuretics, fluoxetine, NSAIDs.\
